# Overlay applied on top of the llm_zoomcamp_2026 fixture to build a checkout
# that really carries export attributes.
#
# `git archive` -- what codeload serves the push transport -- honours these.
# A pull transport that reads the working tree, or the `git ls-files` list, does
# not, so the two would project different rows from the same commit.
#
# The first entry removes a manifest the parser reads, so the divergence shows up
# in the projected cohort rows and not only in the file list; the second removes
# a file the parser ignores, so the file list diverges too.
cohorts/2025/cohort.yaml export-ignore
SITE.md export-ignore
